The draft statement of financial position of Chitungwiza Joinery Ltd at 31 December 2025 shows current assets of US\$112,400 (including inventory at cost) and current liabilities of US\$58,900. The draft profit for the year is US\$61,500. The auditor finds that:

1. inventory includes obsolete timber which cost US\$7,800 and can now be sold for a net amount of US\$3,100;
2. a receivable of US\$8,400 from a customer who is also a supplier was set off against the amount owed to that supplier;
3. a loan of US\$30,000 repayable in ten months was shown as non-current.
